    "summary": "The docgen call-sequence diagram labels each frame with its repo-relative path and line. A page script, inlined in the companion page and both docgen shells, marks code references and posts a click to the parent. The review pane forwards such a message only from its own companion frame, with valid fields, as the existing open-code-ref. A test pins the script's grammar to the chat page's."
